[SE00113] 🐌 STEP BROTHER [Line 2]: A step of 0 would never get anywhere. Ranges walk forward in steps of 1 or more.
  --> bad_step.splat:2:20
   |
 2 | spin i in 0..10 by 0:
   |                    ^
  Fix: Use a step of at least 1 (for example '0..10 by 2'); to count down, wrap the range in 'rev(...)'.

[SE00113] 🐌 STEP BROTHER [Line 5]: A step of -2 would never get anywhere. Ranges walk forward in steps of 1 or more.
  --> bad_step.splat:5:20
   |
 5 | spin i in 10..0 by -2:
   |                    ^^
  Fix: Use a step of at least 1 (for example '0..10 by 2'); to count down, wrap the range in 'rev(...)'.

